)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;3. Escolha dois vértices adjacentes e explique por que são considerados vizinhos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;- (2,3) e (3,4)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;- Vértices adjacentes são considerados vizinhos quando uma mesma aresta os liga.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;Mona Sans VF, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Noto Sans Backtick Fix, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Escolha dois vértices não adjacentes e justifique sua resposta.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- (1,3) e (2,4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212)); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- Vértices não adjacentes são aqueles que não são conectados por uma mesma aresta.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
